    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Saleem Islam, Chair of the Department of Surgery at the Aga Khan University (AKU) and a distinguished alumnus of our MBBS Class of 1992, has secured his place in history as the first Pakistani to become the Chair of the Surgery Section at the American Academy of Pediatrics.",
